==============================================================================
2c. DETECTION COVERAGE - what caught it, and what is blind to it
==============================================================================

F1  Fahrenheit temperature
    caught by : jitter ratio = 1.8 (the F signature)
    missed by : correlation -- affine-invariant, blind to scale

F2  clock +2h on SENS-07
    caught by : light cross-correlation vs peers
    missed by : cadence check -- grid is regular, just offset

F3  moisture frozen at 25.01
    caught by : run-length + cross-channel
    missed by : range check -- 25.01 is a legal value

F4  SENS-03 EC drift
    caught by : early-vs-late median vs own noise
    missed by : correlation -- EC has no shared signal

F5  SENS-04 above the spec ceiling
    caught by : spec range + jitter + dry-down
    missed by : null check -- the readings are present

F6  single-sample glitches and one unexplained pattern
    caught by : range check; light spikes found by comparing against neighbours
    missed by : run-length -- they are isolated samples

F7  SENS-05 missing 193 slots
    caught by : expected-slot grid
    missed by : null count -- there are zero nulls

F8  15 duplicate rows on SENS-08
    caught by : key cardinality
    missed by : value checks -- the duplicates are all legal

F9  user_plant_id fans out on join
    caught by : join cardinality, before joining
    missed by : value checks -- the data is fine, the key is not

F10  two sensors on one plant
    caught by : inter-device correlation
    missed by : single-device checks -- each looks healthy alone

F11  watering logs vs the sensor
    caught by : event detection vs the log table
    missed by : sensor-only or log-only -- each consistent

F12  environment near-identical
    caught by : cross-device correlation per channel
    missed by : single-device checks; also range checks

F13  substrate label, no effective dating
    caught by : manual log cross-reference
    missed by : everything -- needs the app's config history

13 findings; every one defeats at least one obvious check

